From b5bb98297a1765d71160dd62d1cd53863f948012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomasrgbsf <273673612+Tomasrgbsf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:22:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(evidence): retain distinct provider effect observations
 through recovery

Append source changes and observations following uncertainty instead of deduplicating by logical ACK content. Keep true latest-event retries idempotent under BEGIN IMMEDIATE. Migration 0016 preserves old rows, identities, sequences, and allocator floors; recovery retains the first terminal barrier and rejects obsolete content-unique indexes. Add cold-open, repeated-observation, multi-writer, clock-boundary, and migration regressions. Native qualification is pending and no whole-runtime acceptance is asserted.
